  "ended_on_llm_error": false,
  "final_message": "The store finder is built: a Flask API under `/api` serving a React + Tailwind frontend, with data in SQLite at `data/app.db`. I couldn't build or run the Docker image because Docker isn't available here. Instead I ran the app under gunicorn locally and checked health, nearby search, admin sign-in, validation errors and the frontend page by hand; all worked. The 12 backend tests pass, and the frontend type-checks and builds.\n\n- **Backend** (`backend/app.py`): accounts and tokens, the store endpoints, and the 8 sample stores. The samples are added on the first start only, so deleted ones don't come back after a restart.\n- **Admin**: the password comes only from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; if it's unset or empty, admin sign-in fails. Changing or removing the password also ends existing admin sessions.\n- **Frontend**: sign-in form, store list with search, \"Use my location\" with a radius selector, and a plot drawn as an SVG on the page. If location permission is denied, the full list stays with a short note. The admin gets add/edit forms that show the API's error messages per field, and delete asks for confirmation.\n\nChoices the spec left open:\n- **Default radius**: with `lat`/`lng` but no `radius`, the search uses 25 km.\n- **Bad query values**: an invalid `lat`/`lng`/`radius` gets a 400 error, as does `lat` without `lng` (or the reverse).\n- **Wrong account**: a signed-in user who isn't the admin gets 403 on admin endpoints (no token or a bad token gets 401).\n- **Rules for accounts**: usernames are 3\u201332 characters, passwords at least 8, and `admin` can't be registered as a normal account.\n- **Extra endpoints**: I added `GET /api/auth/me` and `POST /api/auth/logout`, which the frontend uses.\n\nI also added:\n- the backend tests in `backend/tests/`\n- a `typecheck` script in the frontend\n- a `.gitignore`\n- a short section in `README.md` on running it with `ADMIN_PASSWORD`\n\nTo install the backend dependencies locally I had to upgrade pip inside `.venv` first; the image's install step wasn't tested.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
